  29:dependencies/libDaisy/src/daisy_seed.h ****     /** 
  30:dependencies/libDaisy/src/daisy_seed.h ****     Initializes the Daisy Seed and the following peripherals:
  31:dependencies/libDaisy/src/daisy_seed.h ****     SDRAM, QSPI, 24-bit 48kHz Audio via AK4556, Internal USB,
  32:dependencies/libDaisy/src/daisy_seed.h ****     as well as the built-in LED and Testpoint.
